{
  "tema": 5985,
  "slug": "ser-de-estar-hecho-de",
  "titulo": "Estar hecho de or ser de to say what something is made of",
  "subtitulo": "La tabla es de fibra de vidrio / está hecha de fibra de vidrio.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Material: ser de + material, or estar hecho de + material (hecho agrees: hecha, hechos, hechas). Question: ¿De qué es? / ¿De qué está hecho?",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say what something is **made of**, you can use **ser** or **estar**, in two slightly different ways:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Verb",
            "Pattern",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "ser",
              "ser + de + material",
              "La casa es de madera."
            ],
            [
              "estar",
              "estar + hecho + de + material",
              "La casa está hecha de madera."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Hecho** works as an adjective, so it **agrees** with the thing: **hecho**, **hecha**, **hechos**, **hechas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To ask, **de** comes first: **¿De qué es?** or **¿De qué está hecho?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ser de** is short; **estar hecho de** tells you it was built, and it agrees like a participle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "La casa ==es de== madera.",
              "en": "The house is made of wood."
            },
            {
              "es": "La casa ==está hecha de== madera.",
              "en": "The house is made of wood."
            },
            {
              "es": "La sudadera ==es de== algodón.",
              "en": "The sweatshirt is made of cotton."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las lámparas ==están hechas de== vidrio.",
              "en": "The lamps are made of glass."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi tabla ==está hecha de== fibra de vidrio.",
              "en": "My board is made of fiberglass."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las macetas del huerto ==son de== llantas viejas.",
              "en": "The garden planters are made of old tires."
            },
            {
              "es": "—¿==De qué está hecha== la figura? —De barro.",
              "en": "\"What's the figurine made of?\" \"Clay.\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
